SUMMARY:The Moon occults Jupiter (disappearance only)
DESCRIPTION:Jupiter disappears at 14:39:58 EAT\, seen from Nairobi\, KE.\nT
 he Moon sets during the occultation: only the disappearance is above the h
 orizon.\nThe Moon is 5° up in the WNW · daylight\, Sun +55°.\nTimes aga
 inst the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's edge: 
 https://occult.alokm.com/jupiter-2026-10-06?city=Nairobi%2C%20KE
